t const check = (x: never) => assertNever(x);\\n\"}},\"rationale\":\"The constraints catch a literal local assertNever definition on one line of an added file in the scoped packages. They cannot decide three things: a renamed copy of the helper, a definition spread over several lines, or whether the import really resolves to the schema package's utils. Those need judgement.\"}",
